      "writtenOn": "2022-09-09T10:22:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for questioning the fundamentals but I find this approach weird. Wouldn\u0027t it be cleaner to issue the HVCs when we create those mappings? Isn\u0027t this just a remnant of how we did things in U-boot?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 29,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 29,
        "endChar": 61
      },
      "revId": "292a7da17358126e0f3f68620a94dcb9fe13bc72",
